<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>pixel API</title>
    <style>
        *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; background: #0f0f0f; color: #e2e2e2; padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; }
        header { margin-bottom: 3rem; }
        h1 { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; }
        h1 span { color: #a78bfa; }
        .tagline { color: #666; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-top: 0.25rem; }
        .base-url { margin-top: 0.75rem; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; background: #161616; border: 1px solid #222; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem; }
        .base-url code { font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #a78bfa; }
        .base-url button { background: #1e1b4b; color: #c4b5fd; border: none; border-radius: 4px; padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem; font-size: 0.7rem; cursor: pointer; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; transition: background 0.15s; }
        .base-url button:hover { background: #2e1f6f; }
        section { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
        h2 { font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #555; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; padding-bottom: 0.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #1e1e1e; }
        .endpoint { display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: flex-start; padding: 0.9rem 1rem; background: #161616; border: 1px solid #222; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
        .endpoint:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
        .method { font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; background: #1e1b4b; color: #a78bfa; padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 0.15rem; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
        .info { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
        .path { font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #f0f0f0; word-break: break-all; }
        .path em { color: #a78bfa; font-style: normal; }
        .desc { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #777; margin-top: 0.2rem; }
        .params { margin-top: 0.55rem; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.35rem; }
        .param { font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 0.72rem; background: #1e1e1e; border: 1px solid #2a2a2a; border-radius: 4px; padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem; color: #999; }
        .param b { color: #c4b5fd; font-weight: 500; }
        .try-link { font-size: 0.72rem; color: #555; margin-left: 0.3rem; transition: color 0.15s; }
        .try-link:hover { color: #a78bfa; }
        a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
        a:hover .path { text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: #444; }
        .info-section { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
        .info-section h2 { font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #555; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; padding-bottom: 0.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #1e1e1e; }
        .info-box { background: #161616; border: 1px solid #222; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1rem 1.25rem; }
        .info-box p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: #999; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
        .info-box p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
        .info-box code { font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #c4b5fd; }
        .categories-list { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem; margin-top: 0.75rem; }
        .category-tag { font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 0.78rem; background: #1e1b4b; color: #a78bfa; padding: 0.2rem 0.65rem; border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none; transition: background 0.15s; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.35rem; }
        .category-tag:hover { background: #2e1f6f; }
        .category-count { font-size: 0.68rem; color: #7c6fc4; }
        .code-block { background: #1a1a1a; border: 1px solid #2a2a2a; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #c4b5fd; overflow-x: auto; margin-top: 0.5rem; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.5; }
        .code-block .comment { color: #555; }
        .code-block .string { color: #86efac; }
        .code-block .key { color: #a78bfa; }
        .code-block .number { color: #fbbf24; }
        .error-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 0.5rem; }
        .error-table th, .error-table td { text-align: left; padding: 0.45rem 0.75rem; font-size: 0.82rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #1e1e1e; }
        .error-table th { color: #555; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.72rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
        .error-table td { color: #999; }
        .error-table td code { color: #c4b5fd; }
        .license-text { font-size: 0.75rem; color: #555; line-height: 1.5; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>pixel <span>API</span></h1>
        <p class="tagline">Random image server</p>
        {% if baseUrl %}
        <div class="base-url">
            <code id="base-url">{{ baseUrl }}</code>
            <button onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(document.getElementById('base-url').textContent)">copy</button>
        </div>
        {% endif %}
    </header>

    {% for group in groups %}
    <section>
        <h2>{{ group.label }}</h2>
        {% for endpoint in group.endpoints %}
        <div class="endpoint">
            <span class="method">{{ endpoint.method }}</span>
            <div class="info">
                <div class="path">
                    {% if endpoint.url is defined %}
                        <a href="{{ endpoint.url }}">{{ endpoint.path | raw }}</a>
                        <a href="{{ endpoint.url }}" class="try-link">try it</a>
                    {% else %}
                        {{ endpoint.path | raw }}
                    {% endif %}
                </div>
                <div class="desc">{{ endpoint.desc }}</div>
                {% if endpoint.params is defined %}
                <div class="params">
                    {% for param in endpoint.params %}
                    <span class="param"><b>{{ param.name }}</b> {{ param.hint }}</span>
                    {% endfor %}
                </div>
                {% endif %}
            </div>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
    </section>
    {% endfor %}

    <div class="info-section">
        <h2>Example Response</h2>
        <div class="info-box">
            <p><code>GET /api/v2/{{ firstCategory }}/images?per_page=1</code></p>
            <div class="code-block">{
  <span class="key">"category"</span>: <span class="string">"{{ firstCategory }}"</span>,
  <span class="key">"page"</span>: <span class="number">1</span>,
  <span class="key">"per_page"</span>: <span class="number">1</span>,
  <span class="key">"total"</span>: <span class="number">{{ categoryCounts[firstCategory] | default(0) }}</span>,
  <span class="key">"total_pages"</span>: <span class="number">{{ categoryCounts[firstCategory] | default(1) }}</span>,
  <span class="key">"images"</span>: [
    {
      <span class="key">"filename"</span>: <span class="string">"example.jpg"</span>,
      <span class="key">"url"</span>: <span class="string">"{{ baseUrl }}/images/{{ firstCategory }}/example.jpg"</span>,
      <span class="key">"size"</span>: <span class="number">204800</span>,
      <span class="key">"mime"</span>: <span class="string">"image/jpeg"</span>
    }
  ]
}</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="info-section">
        <h2>Quick Start</h2>
        <div class="info-box">
            <p>Embed a random image in HTML:</p>
            <div class="code-block">&lt;img src=<span class="string">"{{ baseUrl }}/api/v2/{{ firstCategory }}/random"</span> alt=<span class="string">"random image"</span>&gt;</div>
            <p style="margin-top: 0.75rem;">Or fetch with curl:</p>
            <div class="code-block"><span class="comment"># Get a random image URL</span>
curl -s {{ baseUrl }}/api/v2/{{ firstCategory }}/images?per_page=1 | python3 -m json.tool

<span class="comment"># Download a random image</span>
curl -o image.jpg {{ baseUrl }}/api/v2/{{ firstCategory }}/random</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    {% if categories is not empty %}
    <div class="info-section">
        <h2>Available Categories</h2>
        <div class="info-box">
            <p>Use any of these as the <code>{category}</code> parameter:</p>
            <div class="categories-list">
                {% for category in categories %}
                <a href="/api/v2/{{ category }}/random" class="category-tag">{{ category }} <span class="category-count">({{ categoryCounts[category] | default(0) }})</span></a>
                {% endfor %}
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="info-section">
        <h2>Rate Limit</h2>
        <div class="info-box">
            <p>The API rate limit is <code>{{ rateLimitMax }}</code> requests per <code>{{ rateLimitWindow }}</code> seconds per IP address.</p>
            <p>When the limit is exceeded, the API returns <code>429 Too Many Requests</code> with a <code>Retry-After</code> header.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="info-section">
        <h2>Error Responses</h2>
        <div class="info-box">
            <table class="error-table">
                <thead>
                    <tr><th>Status</th><th>Meaning</th></tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr><td><code>404</code></td><td>Category not found or route not matched</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>405</code></td><td>HTTP method not allowed</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>429</code></td><td>Rate limit exceeded &mdash; check the <code>Retry-After</code> header</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>500</code></td><td>Internal server error</td></tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="info-section">
        <h2>License</h2>
        <div class="info-box">
            <p class="license-text">THE SERVICE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM, OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE SOFTWARE.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
